Each analysis changed one element of the adult model and recalibrated the cortical background on the measured gradiometer brain noise, as the adult comparison does; the joint runs changed them together. Intervals are from << F.meth_boot_noise_sens >> parcel-bootstrap resamples of one anatomy. The spike simulations were not repeated under these alternatives.

